疾病状态：中重度；在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上仍残留症状的成人HFrEF患者","quote_sha256":"eee2450d9723c5490db6c5a3ab42a40e674f6084a2ff533c46eb680d7202c128","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"span-def-population"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["span-sel-4.1-design","span-def-overall-design","span-def-population"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的II期、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心剂量探索临床研究，研究对象为在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上仍残留症状的慢性射血分数降低型心力衰竭（HFrEF）成人患者。研究设置SGC-R21低剂量组（2.5mg每日一次）、SGC-R21高剂量组（5mg每日一次）和安慰剂组（口服安慰剂每日一次），按1:1:1平行随机分配，双盲条件下连续治疗12周。研究目的为概念验证和剂量探索。","rationale":"支持正文的已确认事实包括II期剂量探索、随机双盲安慰剂对照平行组多中心设计、1:1:1随机、SGC-R21 2.5mg和5mg每日一次及安慰剂每日一次、连续12周。医学作者需核对目标人群描述、研究分期和给药方案表述与已确认研究事实一致。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_22672a4222402624","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:df8f50f427e55c9ac73d6baf","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001003310_a59f4eb5","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_cb40af386f90d99b:full-draft:df8f50f427e55c9ac73d6baf","quote":"主要估计目标：随机化人群第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化；死亡或心衰住院退出按治疗策略处理","quote_sha256":"5089261f6fb3be2e1b473b440c3793a74de4b088e58130278b1d0d40645826ab","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:df8f50f427e55c9ac73d6baf","span_id":"span-sel-4.2-estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"估计目标策略：主要估计目标：随机化人群第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化；死亡或心衰住院退出按治疗策略处理","quote_sha256":"ea47bfa07c916159b23780a8ca24966b211e458bf468d2400559c97bd08946ee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"span-def-estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","quote":"内在研究目的：概念验证（PoC）；剂量探索","quote_sha256":"2d096e242bbd65d0c9236718d79e77a388e84cb9640b99bd47662a6ce8faab31","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","span_id":"span-def-objective"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["span-sel-4.2-estimand","span-def-estimand","span-def-objective"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[],"heading":"设计依据","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为II期剂量探索研究，内在研究目的包括概念验证和剂量探索，目标人群为在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上仍残留症状的成人HFrEF患者。基于上述目的，研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计，以支持在目标人群中评价SGC-R21两个剂量水平相对于安慰剂的效应。主要估计目标为随机化人群第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化；对于死亡或心衰住院退出，按治疗策略处理。","rationale":"支持正文的已确认事实为II期概念验证和剂量探索目的、随机双盲安慰剂对照平行组多中心设计、主要估计目标为随机化人群第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化、死亡或心衰住院退出按治疗策略处理。医学作者需核对估计目标与伴发事件处理策略是否与统计分析计划一致。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（估计目标）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_408131c3085d45ff","section_number":"4.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:df8f50f427e55c9ac73d6baf","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001003310_a59f4eb5","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindi