ng","gap_id":"gap-4.3-randomization-implementation","missing_source_classes":["随机化方案/统计分析与随机化计划","交互式应答系统（IWRS/IRT）说明","紧急揭盲标准操作程序"],"target":"4.3 随机化"}],"heading":"随机化","missing_source_classes":["随机化方案/统计分析与随机化计划","交互式应答系统（IWRS/IRT）说明","紧急揭盲标准操作程序"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配，计划将符合入排标准的受试者按1:1:1比例平行随机分配至SGC-R21低剂量组、SGC-R21高剂量组和安慰剂组三个组别。研究采用双盲、安慰剂对照、多中心设计，随机化分配在双盲条件下实施，以支持组间基线可比性和结果评价的客观性。","rationale":"支持正文的已确认事实为采用随机化分配、按1:1:1平行随机分配至SGC-R21低剂量组、高剂量组和安慰剂组，研究为双盲、安慰剂对照、多中心设计。医学作者需核对随机化实施方式、分层因素和紧急揭盲流程是否有项目文件支持。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（随机化）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_2dae24a32585aaab","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:df8f50f427e55c9ac73d6baf","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9d06a6fe01b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"446d3cc1290e2f0758d587deb1bae3ed468e902b20c60ca621ec5668c1c6a696","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d1d111357b42_cb40af386f90d99b:full-draft:df8f50f427e55c9ac73d6baf","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:df8f50f427e55c9ac73d6baf","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:3b2e251e11bb8cba8063752ef5c824857036f2d4a6568821606758be43b3b1f2:df8f50f427e55c9ac73d6baf","text_sha256":"446d3cc1290e2f0758d587deb1bae3ed468e902b20c60ca621ec5668c1c6a696"},{"content_sha256":"e49aa119fa79fb97c9ada834451eb7ccce1aae054f2913549c0f6b2070265bec","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_66d98f3917295e20f566:r4:9af9d9